%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afcf72fb061a8b44dbcdbccf3f33e410, type: 3}
  m_Name: D7EF1_FinalEndingDialogueSO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequence:
  - speakerNPC: 4
    npcDialogueText: Keep the wheel straight and sail. We'll be in open ocean daylight
      in a few hours.
    buttonText: Smooth waters
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: All that time wasted back there... when all we needed was a
      damn boat.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 4
    npcDialogueText: Anything is possible when you stop following the rules they
      set for you.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: Speaking of rules... how did you actually get this boat? I know
      the Indian gave you a job, but what was it?
    buttonText: The new guy
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: The corpse in the stockroom? You cleared him out the second
      he arrived?
    buttonText: Indian's job
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: Does the Boss know?
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: He'd be floating face down if the Boss knew
    buttonText: He knows
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: He knows? And he just let you walk onto this deck?
    buttonText: He covered me
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: Why would he put his own neck on the line for you?
    buttonText: Island rules
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: The debts and the crooks? What do you mean?
    buttonText: Nobody leaves
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: Right... You're either trapped by a debt that never shrinks,
      or stuck in a feud with another crook
    buttonText: Exactly
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: And when the people who run this rock find out the new guy was
      murdered...
    buttonText: We're dead apparently
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: So the Boss took the blame? Just to give us a shot?
    buttonText: He sinks with his ship
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 4
    npcDialogueText: A proper captain. May the ocean treat his soul gently.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: Guess those people will never collect our debts now. But at
      least we're out.
    buttonText: Pianist was right
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: Right about what?
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: The green bottle? The emeralds?
    buttonText: Found it
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: Then you're a rich man. You can enjoy the coconuts on an island
      of your own once we hit land.
    buttonText: No more islands
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: Wait... if what you said is true, you can only be sent there
      for two reasons.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: The three of us had debts. But what's your story, balcony guy?
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 4
    npcDialogueText: No debt on my shoulders. Just a conflict.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: With who?
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 4
    npcDialogueText: ...
    buttonText: Leave it
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 36
    npcDialogueText: The island is fading behind us.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
  - speakerNPC: 0
    npcDialogueText: Time to finally start living.
    buttonText: ...
    hasMonologue: 0
    monologueLine:
      text: 
      duration: 0
      pauseAfterDuration: 0
